{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42520","headline":"从幸秦川过白卫献诗 · 韩昭","name":"从幸秦川过白卫献诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾王巡狩爲安边，此去秦亭尚数千。\n夜照路岐山店火，晓通消息戍瓶烟。\n爲云巫峡虽神女，跨凤秦楼是谪仙。\n八骏似龙人似虎，何愁飞过大漫天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}